*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% HP LaserJet Professional P1102w - native macOS driver (no Ghostscript)
*% Pipeline: PDF -> cgpdftoraster (macOS) -> rastertozjs -> foo2zjs -> ZjStream
*% foo2zjs is GPL-2.0-or-later, (c) Rick Richardson.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "P1102WZJ.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "HP"
*Product: "(HP LaserJet Professional P1102w)"
*Product: "(HP LaserJet Professional P1102)"
*ModelName: "HP LaserJet Professional P1102w"
*ShortNickName: "HP LaserJet P1102w ZjStream"
*NickName: "HP LaserJet Professional P1102w (ZjStream native)"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Hewlett-Packard;MDL:HP LaserJet Professional P1102w;CMD:ZJS,PJL;"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "18"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 1.4
*cupsModelNumber: 2
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 /Library/Printers/HP_P1102w_ZJS/filter/rastertozjs"
*cupsLanguages: "en"

*% The engine is driven at 1200x600 (as upstream foo2zjs does for this model).
*% 8-bit gray from CoreGraphics; rastertozjs halftones it to 1 bit.
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 1200x600dpi
*Resolution 1200x600dpi/1200 x 600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[1200 600]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 18>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Letter
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A6/A6: "<</PageSize[297 420]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize B5/JIS B5: "<</PageSize[516 729]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Env10/Envelope #10: "<</PageSize[297 684]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvDL/Envelope DL: "<</PageSize[312 624]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvC5/Envelope C5: "<</PageSize[459 649]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvMonarch/Envelope Monarch: "<</PageSize[279 540]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Postcard/Postcard: "<</PageSize[283 420]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Letter
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A6/A6: "<</PageSize[297 420]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion B5/JIS B5: "<</PageSize[516 729]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Env10/Envelope #10: "<</PageSize[297 684]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvDL/Envelope DL: "<</PageSize[312 624]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvC5/Envelope C5: "<</PageSize[459 649]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvMonarch/Envelope Monarch: "<</PageSize[279 540]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Postcard/Postcard: "<</PageSize[283 420]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*% Printable area: the engine clips 0.16in on every edge; 12pt keeps content inside.
*DefaultImageableArea: Letter
*ImageableArea Letter: "12 12 600 780"
*ImageableArea Legal: "12 12 600 996"
*ImageableArea Executive: "12 12 510 744"
*ImageableArea A4: "12 12 583 830"
*ImageableArea A5: "12 12 408 583"
*ImageableArea A6: "12 12 285 408"
*ImageableArea B5: "12 12 504 717"
*ImageableArea Env10: "12 12 285 672"
*ImageableArea EnvDL: "12 12 300 612"
*ImageableArea EnvC5: "12 12 447 637"
*ImageableArea EnvMonarch: "12 12 267 528"
*ImageableArea Postcard: "12 12 271 408"

*DefaultPaperDimension: Letter
*PaperDimension Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal: "612 1008"
*PaperDimension Executive: "522 756"
*PaperDimension A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension A5: "420 595"
*PaperDimension A6: "297 420"
*PaperDimension B5: "516 729"
*PaperDimension Env10: "297 684"
*PaperDimension EnvDL: "312 624"
*PaperDimension EnvC5: "459 649"
*PaperDimension EnvMonarch: "279 540"
*PaperDimension Postcard: "283 420"

*% Options below are read by rastertozjs from the job options, not by the RIP.
*OpenUI *MediaType/Paper Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *MediaType
*DefaultMediaType: Plain
*MediaType Plain/Plain: ""
*MediaType Light/Light (60-74 g/m2): ""
*MediaType Recycled/Recycled: ""
*MediaType Cardstock/Heavy / Cardstock: ""
*MediaType Rough/Rough: ""
*MediaType Labels/Labels: ""
*MediaType Envelope/Envelope: ""
*MediaType Transparency/Transparency: ""
*MediaType Letterhead/Letterhead: ""
*MediaType Preprinted/Preprinted: ""
*MediaType Prepunched/Prepunched: ""
*CloseUI: *MediaType

*OpenUI *PrintDensity/Print Density: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *PrintDensity
*DefaultPrintDensity: 3
*PrintDensity 1/1 (Lightest): ""
*PrintDensity 2/2: ""
*PrintDensity 3/3 (Normal): ""
*PrintDensity 4/4: ""
*PrintDensity 5/5 (Darkest): ""
*CloseUI: *PrintDensity

*OpenUI *EconoMode/Toner Saver: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *EconoMode
*DefaultEconoMode: False
*EconoMode True/On: ""
*EconoMode False/Off: ""
*CloseUI: *EconoMode

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica: Standard "(001.006S)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Roman: Standard "(001.007S)" Standard ROM
